=== COMPILER2 DIAGNOSTICS ===
  [type] E0181

  × initialization cycle: global `PING` needs its own value to be initialized (`PING` → `PONG` → `PING`) — globals are initialized once, at startup, in dependency order, and no order can satisfy a
  │ cycle
    ╭─[initializers.baml:13:14]
 13 │ const PING = PONG + 1;
    ·              ────
    ╰────

  [type] E0181

  × initialization cycle: global `THROUGH_HELPER` needs its own value to be initialized (`THROUGH_HELPER` → `reads_through_helper` → `THROUGH_HELPER`) — globals are initialized once, at startup, in
  │ dependency order, and no order can satisfy a cycle
    ╭─[initializers.baml:17:29]
 17 │ const THROUGH_HELPER: int = reads_through_helper();
    ·                             ────────────────────
    ╰────

  [type] E0181

  × initialization cycle: global `THROUGH_DEFAULT` needs its own value to be initialized (`THROUGH_DEFAULT` → `with_default` → `THROUGH_DEFAULT`) — globals are initialized once, at startup, in
  │ dependency order, and no order can satisfy a cycle
    ╭─[initializers.baml:24:30]
